From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:16:09 +0800
Subject: backend: add optional Anland PipeWire services

Keep virtual audio nodes alive across consumer reconnects, negotiate PCM formats over the current Anland protocol, request camera resources, and expose camera streams through PipeWire when libpipewire and libspa are available. Harden the DMA-BUF, resource-fd, audio-packet, and camera-shared-memory handshakes against malformed or truncated input.
